    "title": "Dr. Rebecca Grant of the Lexington Institute on national security discusses the implications of recent meetings with European leaders",
    "text": "Dr. Rebecca Grant of the Lexington Institute on national security discusses the implications of recent meetings with European leaders\nImage\nJust the News\nDr. Rebecca Grant from the Lexington Institute discusses with John Solomon the recent White House meeting that brought together eight or nine world leaders, highlighting a renewed sense of unity between the U.S. and Europe in the wake of Trump's return. The discussion focused on key concerns, including French President Emmanuel Macron’s emphasis on the need to contain Russia, and Germany’s call for a ceasefire following Putin’s trilateral engagement.",
